l":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23047#issuecomment-1439743767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23047","id":1439743767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBFIx285V0L8X","user":{"login":"gelven4sec","id":37241392,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQxMzky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37241392?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec","html_url":"https://github.com/gelven4sec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gelven4sec/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-22T10:06:49Z","updated_at":"2023-02-22T10:06:49Z","body":"Okay I finally got this right !\r\n\r\nDue to my poor knowledge about Traefik, I though setting up the middleware with the same name as the service would automatically assign it.\r\n\r\nSolution : \r\n```\r\nlabels:\r\n      - \"traefik.enable=true\"\r\n      - \"traefik.http.routers.gitea.tls=true\"\r\n      - \"traefik.http.routers.gitea.rule=Host(`domain`) && PathPrefix(`/git`)\"\r\n      - \"traefik.http.services.gitea.loadbalancer.server.port=3000\"\r\n      - \"traefik.http.middlewares.gitea-stripprefix.stripprefix.prefixes=/git\"\r\n      - \"traefik.http.routers.gitea.middlewares=gitea-stripprefix\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nI would be happy to provide a PR to update the documentation, which would close this ticket.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","r